      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the City, at the 1967 Session of the Legislature, sponsored the enactment of Laws 1967, Ch. 379, which authorizes the Mayor, the City's executive order, to continue such increased-take-home-pay plan during the City's 1967-1968 fiscal year; and",
